<title>POLAND: Krosno Q4 net rises to PLN 2.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Krosno Q4 net rises to PLN 2.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krosno results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 4.11 vs    1.36</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   4.12 vs    3.23</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.90 vs    2.09</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Krosnienskie Huty Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 44.88 vs   42.23</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  31.69 vs   29.80</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.00 vs    0.00</p>
